{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and take an object, check its properties and perform a specific task, then move to destination. list of available nodes: <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
